      "description": "A question Owen answers ON the page (a details page's;  epic `epic-workflow` P12):  its text an `<epic-question>`, its options an `<epic-choices>` of `<epic-option>`s, each with a tick box, then an Other box.  Its line shows a chip in the epic page's state colours (red:  nothing yet;  green:  picked;  blue:  Claude has more to do).  Its answer goes under its section's id.",
      "noun": "ask",
      "attributes": [
        {
          "name": "name",
          "kind": "string",
          "description": "The key its answer goes under (`q1`);  none:  its `<ui-section>`'s id.  Its options' comments are `<key>-<letter>` (`q1-B`)."
        },
        {
          "name": "multiple",
          "kind": "boolean",
          "description": "Pick several (tick boxes);  without it, pick one (round ones)."
        },
        {
          "name": "select-all",
