      "description": "One row of a choice page (epic `epic-workflow` P12), in an `<epic-choice-rows>`:  the use site (File, opening VS Code at the line), what it's for, how it reads today, and a box pre-filled with Claude's recommendation.  Owen types over it, or leaves it;  a changed box is orange, with a round button putting the recommendation back.  In a table Owen puts in order (`<epic-choice-rows reorder>`), its place first, with move up / move down.",
