      "description": "The small floating pane Owen writes a NEW comment in (epic `airplane` P11;  Owen, 2026-10-10:  \"a little floating pane below the selected text that I can move around -- don't scroll the page and lose context!\"), drawn by the docs runtime's comments when he clicks a bullhorn or comments on selected text.  Fixed on the screen just under what he clicked (`near`), above it when there's no room below;  he drags it by its header.  Ivory, 8px inside on every side, no buttons below its text.  Its header:  the bullhorn, the first words it's on (its tooltip the block in full), the floppy once saved, the trash once saved, and ×.  Its field is slotted:  the comments' code saves it as he types.",
