      ],
      "aka": [
        "hidden note",
        "show all",
        "N hidden"
      ],
      "description": "Under a list the state filter (`<epic-state-filter>`) hides items of:  a quiet line, `3 hidden · show all`;  a click asks its owner to show everything again (`epic-show-all`).  Drawn by `<epic-section>` under its items, and by the docs runtime under the Epics page's lists.  Nothing hidden:  its owner leaves it out.",
      "noun": "hidden-note",
      "attributes": [
        {
          "name": "count",
