        },
        {
          "name": "reviewing",
          "kind": "boolean",
          "description": "PAGE state, never in a doc:  the page is being reviewed -- served by the page server with a token, its review inbox answering -- so items and Overview parts show their review controls, and the header Send and its countdown.  Set by them (P9, `ReviewState`);  the old runtime's `body.plan-reviewing`."
        }
