      "description": "The Epics page's sort buttons (Owen, 2026-10-13:  \"Add buttons to epics header to sort by date or alphabetical\"):  A–Z sorts each group of every `<epic-list>` on the page by title, Date by when each epic was last worked on, newest first.  The one in use is pressed, and remembered in this browser.  The docs runtime puts it in the Epics page's header.",
      "noun": "sort",
