      "description": "A box Owen types in, on a page he answers on (epic `epic-workflow` P12):  one line to start, growing with its text.  What he types is part of the page's answer, by `type` and `for`:  the page's notes, a comment on a section or an option, a question's Other, a choice page's feedback.  The page's notes box also shows what the page KEPT (P18):  text typed for a question, option or section an agent's rewrite took off the page, under its old title, sent with the rest until Owen drops it.",
      "noun": "text box",
      "attributes": [
        {
          "name": "type",
          "kind": "enum",
          "values": [
            "notes",
            "comment",
            "other",
            "feedback",
            "note"
          ],
          "default": "comment",
          "description": "What it holds:  `notes` (the page's notes for Claude, once a page), `comment` (on the section `for` names, or an option, `q1-B`), `other` (question `for`'s Other, drawn by `<epic-ask>`), `feedback` (a choice page's, drawn by `<epic-choices-bar>`), `note` (none of a page's answer:  read by the element drawing it, a test run's failure note, `<epic-test-run>`)."
        },
        {
          "name": "for",
          "kind": "string",
          "property": "htmlFor",
          "description": "Whose it is:  a comment's section id (`context`) or option (`q1-B`), Other's question key (`q1`).  Notes and feedback need none."
        },
        {
          "name": "placeholder",
          "kind": "string",
          "description": "Its grey hint while empty;  none:  its type's own (`Notes for Claude:  anything, any time`)."
        },
        {
          "name": "label",
          "kind": "string",
          "description": "Its name for a screen reader;  none:  its placeholder."
        }
      ],
      "slots": [],
      "events": [],
      "parts": [
        {
          "name": "base",
          "description": "The box around the text field."
        },
        {
          "name": "field",
          "description": "The `<textarea>`:  one line to start, growing with its text to a third of the window."
        },
        {
          "name": "kept",
          "description": "A notes box's KEPT text, above its field, while there is any:  an orange-edged box, \"Kept from before the page changed\", then each text."
        },
        {
          "name": "kept-item",
