      "description": "An UPDATE (Owen, 2026-10-11):  a block titled `Update: <summary>`, its date at the right, what changed under it.  A phase's plan change sits at the end of its phase's description (after Goal);  an update to prose right after the block it changed.  Empty, with no `summary` or `at`:  the orange UPDATE label on an item changed while a phase is active.",
